   ->  Seq Scan on par_test_p2_s4 par_test_4
         Filter: ((a IS NULL) OR (b IS NULL) OR (c IS NULL) OR (d IS NULL))
   ->  Seq Scan on par_test_p3_s5 par_test_5
         Filter: ((a IS NULL) OR (b IS NULL) OR (c IS NULL) OR (d IS NULL))
   ->  Seq Scan on par_test_p3_s6 par_test_6
         Filter: ((a IS NULL) OR (b IS NULL) OR (c IS NULL) OR (d IS NULL))
(13 rows)

